### AND_CLAUSES   [logic: connectives, quantifiers, equality, extensionality]
hash: 984c7e9a6a57999089ad22b53f6a110e
source: !t:bool. (T /\ t <=> t) /\ (t /\ T <=> t) /\ (F /\ t <=> F) /\ (t /\ F <=> F) /\ (t /\ t <=> t)
